[{"title":"赵主簿以许旌阳李八百像刻来因得二首 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"眇眇西山路，谁知许旌阳。\n馀事断蛟尔，剑气聊自藏。\n群阴养魑魅，往往常披猖。\n安得从其游，像刻不可忘。\n君能一吊古，摹遗劳持将。\n定非凡子须，相与弥慨慷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25551,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵主簿以许旌阳李八百像刻来因得二首 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"萧萧八百洞，高安尚流传。\n谓李脱亦可，貌出真神仙。\n洗我短世悲，遐哉谓之玄。\n安得从其游，弃置尘垢膻。\n君能一吊古，摹归遗何偏。\n涧头霜叶寒，相与知其贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25552,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海运","author":"韩淲","text":"春山非隐沦，乃作养生计。\n岂无轩裳心，盖欲了千岁。\n当其禀赋初，冲气甚微细。\n谁知忧患多，坐使百脉滞。\n海仙用奇语，安眠可元契。\n因之地炉煖，绵绵见根蒂。\n乾坤一交泰，日月去昏翳。\n万事俱若遗，一身且康济。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25553,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝融吟","author":"韩淲","text":"绍熙三年冬，二十有五日。\n良月信城西，一火近千室。\n其间邸店多，吾亦仅六七。\n暮收五百钱，旦为十口实。\n兹乃例遭焚，隐忍不敢诘。\n閒常巷党人，意谓颇丰逸。\n高者即见鄙，下者但相疾。\n终岁纵栖栖，畴肯顾蓬荜。\n生产今泯焉，诸贤必能悉。\n祝融疑相吾，参元可同律。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25554,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪汛浮桥屡解","author":"韩淲","text":"潢潦涨梅润，五月三解桥。\n浸淫人尚可，恐汎新插苗。\n传闻钱塘湖，闵雨宸虑焦。\n玉帛走群望，虎头潭荡摇。\n如何千里间，阳阴犹未调。\n干戈或底定，丰穰苏瘵凋。\n郊居茅茨湿，不过日寂寥。\n饥寒自常事，鸡鸣复萧萧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25555,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示儿","author":"韩淲","text":"士固贵诵说，人亦要力行。\n气质到深厚，心术尤分明。\n贵贱易迁变，是非多战争。\n直宜刚且正，无复弱而平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25556,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再示子文","author":"韩淲","text":"悌弟其谁家，欢然友于兄。\n饮我一杯酒，北客交旧情。\n凉雨清晚云，庭柯澹阴阴。\n席间长少集，文献各准绳。\n是岂小故哉，宜醉亦宜醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25557,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叔逢尊兄同二犹子季夏奉先翁南山先生初忌祠事宿安固山房长侄赋诗和章盈握余时客峨下莫与省扫东望悲哽入秋乃能赓载随韵写情不敢自以为诗也","author":"韩淲","text":"诗筒南山来，缄题手亲揭。\n三年蓼莪废，楚怆不堪说。\n向来志显扬，岂不愿华烨。\n自量分予薄，敛退畏官热。\n所冀短日延，得奉兰羞洁。\n物聚斯有散，中岂长盍盍。\n吾翁烛此理，至言不苟发。\n谓宜发老更，前后祝哽噎。\n洞天俄趣还，玉锁一笑掣。\n百年会归尽，九原疑可作。\n伤心北冈松，长挂东岭月。\n遥闻朱炜末，省扫俎豆列。\n我独滞三峨，转烛半年别。\n一生未禅悦，静虑已朝彻。\n眷此顾复恩，追远倍悽切。\n阿兄抱渊静，诸阮更姱节。\n无忘溪翁铭，念念攸好德。\n灵源浚演迤，可使中遏绝。\n我虽懦不武，愤世能激烈。\n庶无忝所生，愿赋濂溪拙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25558,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晴窗","author":"韩淲","text":"晴窗已晨炊，趺坐焚清香。\n泥炉拥瓦缶，熟此蟹眼汤。\n茶甘泛松实，舌本味亦长。\n温乎气忽平，兀然梦相忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25559,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壮志","author":"韩淲","text":"壮志老不已，抚剑斥宇宙。\n日月倏过眼，孰得百岁寿。\n只今忍困苦，不必羡贵富。\n盖代事业在，唾手可以就。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25560,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十六夜坐","author":"韩淲","text":"初霜涤馀暖，山气何其明。\n水痕亦渐收，涧浅流不声。\n翔空有鸣雁，肃肃已南征。\n人閒易为老，物引诚可惊。\n凭窗既危坐，出门复安行。\n夜晚村微火，得酒承满觥。\n且了读残书，理惬意逾平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25561,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"身老","author":"韩淲","text":"酬应于外久，身老气亦馁。\n混沦一区宇，涵澄即渊海。\n雅俗诗书迁，炎冷岁节改。\n运转大化间，寿者亦何待。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25562,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老面","author":"韩淲","text":"老面见达官，强附终不近。\n人之所以然，盖我无令闻。\n安富是其时，尊荣本其分。\n只合坐茅庐，灰堆埋牛粪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25563,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"袖手","author":"韩淲","text":"袖手坐春昼，渊渊古井水。\n倦漉渊明巾，姑隐子綦几。\n沉冥极颠末，昭彻贵表里。\n裕矣得失心，隘哉洗其耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25564,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕上","author":"韩淲","text":"收息卧晓枕，鸦声报天明。\n一檐隔市尘，便有嘈杂声。\n今晨雪如何，云何蝗不生。\n且愿蝗不生，明年谷价平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25565,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清坐四鼓","author":"韩淲","text":"僧窗耿清灯，秋虫入虚听。\n风收松声回，夜息人籁定。\n清明养我神，湛寂见我性。\n万有虽自然，唯乐独也正。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25566,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"危坐","author":"韩淲","text":"寒灯梦初觉，危坐收此心。\n心亦合自收，无念即清深。\n举足尘埃起，盈颠霜雪侵。\n枯禅缚意马，练养无胎禽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25567,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶兴 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"少小住京邑，不识世寒煖。\n欢来上高楼，但爱湖水满。\n所历辄忘归，其交亦常款。\n岂伊岁齿深，遂与境事断。\n萧萧宋□宅，赫赫金张馆。\n□坚多侠游，隐约出幽伴。\n胡为乎山中，长歌至于懒。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25568,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶兴 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"轻风度林杪，乱山啼子规。\n流水去无迹，茅檐雨霏微。\n乍暖复薄寒，时时整巾衣。\n炊烟晚色起，呼童掩柴扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25569,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十四日推枕引酒信笔书此","author":"韩淲","text":"空云春昼长，明晦苦参错。\n连朝服衾枕，疲苶不可作。\n岂唯虑归舟，去没逢蛟鳄。\n卧闻耕桑家，种败蚕栖箔。\n忧来故耿耿，政尔须杯勺。\n酸甜无正味，聊以慰寂寞。\n譬如无弦琴，亦寓山水乐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25570,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"南风吹时雨，襟抱忽然开。\n凭轩一长谣，清句亦满怀。\n当年沮溺心，自觉未为乖。\n桑麻涧上泉，何不返故栖。\n帝城尘埃中，隘巷多涂泥。\n摆落更奚道，强颜终莫谐。\n规规二十载，今日始知迷。\n仰视天宇高，归云去难回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25571,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"淫淫梅子雨，靡靡上郭山。\n山既绕篱外，雨复湿窗间。\n林深叶葱茜，地偏水潺湲。\n鹊噪鸡鸣午，风定白云还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25572,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"逸此一寸心，养此七尺躯。\n寒往则暑来，日居而月诸。\n万古固寥远，百年乃须臾。\n仪秦徒纵横，唐虞祇都俞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25573,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"重午是一节，芒种又一气。\n何因至怡悦，底事苦歔欷。\n园林无俗情，琴书有真味。\n贫者自为贫，贵者自为贵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25574,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶感","author":"韩淲","text":"用物多则强，境熟气易定。\n壮胆骋寡见，迷情忽群听。\n茫茫可与否，沓沓贤且佞。\n名利缠古今，孰不堕此径。\n驱驰每冲晓，展转直至暝。\n固肥尔室家，端系我朝廷。\n身无百岁长，事有一日罄。\n留侯李邺侯，大似醉者醒。\n历久只两人，吾常喜深订。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25575,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日思家林","author":"韩淲","text":"篱门绿阴合，涧水通流泉。\n日影过屋外，风声落山前。\n好客时时来，琴尊咏残编。\n馀凉醒午醉，鸟语更清圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25576,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林下","author":"韩淲","text":"林下寂无事，坐对春风晚。\n杜鹃啼一声，花落水流远。\n琴书送日月，胡能计行遁。\n自是得栖迟，奚敢事偃蹇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25577,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"清风穆然至，林影何其明。\n不知春已夏，池荷亦敷荣。\n展簟理竹榻，幽梦时自醒。\n起行散腰脚，气适无留情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25578,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"翾翾蝶粉白，气化随所之。\n人生事物间，自役应自知。\n赏心有馀乐，即目无足悲。\n天运非偶然，神释形已疲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25579,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"云雷布凉雨，早稻叶翻翻。\n携锄走畦町，惜水不厌浑。\n吾方卧涧壑，人奚识丘园。\n望岁可以饱，高歌诵虞轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25580,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"长沟护流沫，沙石拥声处。\n溯洄一镜净，更觉云影住。\n不辞数鱼虾，甚欲下鸥鹭。\n夏气忻已深，今古本如故。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25581,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴 其五","author":"韩淲","text":"独立看流水，草树相因依。\n清回滩声长，碧下波影迟。\n人生老当敛，心口常自违。\n啼禽忽飞来，夏气今如兹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25582,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"人多愁不达，达则定无愁。\n不知所愁何，大半为身谋。\n爵服纵可贵，事业终悠悠。\n以兹旦暮心，且从山水游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25583,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"以我视彼心，当思我如彼。\n未必有所益，徒更纷纭尔。\n世道升降间，古今只一理。\n昧不知其然，如是而已矣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25584,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"当其未生时，孰知我能老。\n既老复须死，何其置怀抱。\n谈空与说妙，终古吻不燥。\n此身无厌生，得酒醉亦好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25585,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"儒者求专门，是岂为我儒。\n乡愿复不佳，必竟将何如。\n未有孔孟前，尧舜非著书。\n观书亦不恶，涂辙亦差殊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25586,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其五","author":"韩淲","text":"四时景自足，何必写以诗。\n诗成句读间，不过我自知。\n但恐两眼昏，心识如乱丝。\n血气一耗散，逐物之所之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25587,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其六","author":"韩淲","text":"种田图得米，终岁亦勤劳。\n当春把锄犁，和风满东皋。\n岂忘水旱忧，流离至逋逃。\n未必可就食，往来徒嗷嗷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25588,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其七","author":"韩淲","text":"士以科举计，本避农与商。\n谋利则皆然，役役真可伤。\n周之士也贵，里选而论乡。\n上人能用之，身尊道弥昌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25589,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其八","author":"韩淲","text":"戎马纷群寇，残害吾赤子。\n被之以礼乐，庶使保生齿。\n如火热水深，亦运之而已。\n治少乱则多，尧舜惟孝悌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25590,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其九","author":"韩淲","text":"幽草清更佳，被花多白红。\n鸟啼蝴蝶乱，村村是春风。\n人无杯酒饮，不得此意融。\n春过夏将至，迤逦成秋冬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25591,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其十","author":"韩淲","text":"佛老多惰民，其书不如此。\n儒者读儒书，饮酒食肉耳。\n古人之糟粕，不过一片纸。\n不读亦自佳，徒以资口耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25592,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其十一","author":"韩淲","text":"古人善为治，焉得常继之。\n施为须臾间，乱之以参差。\n请观一岁年，阴晴每如兹。\n大抵正自难，君子易忧思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25593,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其十二","author":"韩淲","text":"茫茫天地宽，山水多回礴。\n一山复一水，又尔为聚落。\n聚落成城郭，贵贱分忧乐。\n岂不知其然，何苦生厌薄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25594,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"园荒无与锄，草树暗如织。\n披榛理幽步，野气颇有力。\n坐令世网心，不动自然息。\n更见吾潩泉，无波瑩岩色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25595,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"木槿亚红淡，牵牛蔓青滋。\n露晞凉风入，陡觉居处宜。\n岩桂中秋蕊，篱菊重阳枝。\n何必春始荣，物物有其时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25596,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"开轩散幽帙，今昔随所诣。\n何如彻名色，庶不涴声势。\n抚几聊自怡，发牙易凋弊。\n安得同心人，相忘可忘世。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25597,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"亭亭鸡冠花，散出非所莳。\n色与秋日明，叶与秋庭媚。\n山閒人自稀，鸿雁几时至。\n境象吾素知，茅茨下清吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25598,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中杂兴 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"独吟不知秋，独坐不知晚。\n坐久颇搭陀，吟深或偃蹇。\n栖栖与世疏，默默去道远。\n澄渊无起波，长谷有绝巘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25599,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中杂兴 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"凉风固不恶，凉雨诚可佳。\n庭空鸟雀至，篱破藤蔓斜。\n倦体得支吾，睡眼失昏花。\n门前客能来，我亦留茶瓜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25600,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中杂兴 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"蛩吟四壁立，月过一窗閒。\n光明动音闻，此是我家山。\n才短仕固艰，气馁发亦斑。\n人物与天运，初不苦相关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25601,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中杂兴 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"客来难共语，客去宁自孤。\n未能高远引，非斯其谁徒。\n寥寥同心人，一逝不可呼。\n渊明醉即眠，所以爱吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25602,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中杂兴 其五","author":"韩淲","text":"枯禅未离喧，随俗或安雅。\n翻覆大化中，谁是长年者。\n同光须臾期，尘埃野马也。\n风亭木叶下，村村又秋社。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25603,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怀 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"蝴蝶为庄周，黄粱熟邯郸。\n蘧然一梦觉，茫茫天壤间。\n相推明日月，来往成暑寒。\n山林与钟鼎，胸中了不干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25604,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怀 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"东风已飞花，绿叶生昼阴。\n呼童整春服，清溪一啸吟。\n时序遽如许，不知情浅深。\n夕阳忽在山，轻烟起沉沉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25605,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怀 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"单舸下长川，相与两文士。\n欢然叩舷歌，激激响风水。\n山头秀松杉，城阴富桃李。\n周流至桥边，兴极笑而起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25606,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怀 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"浇淳固一致，大抵务归厚。\n百年草栖尘，孔孟已无有。\n书不求甚解，又不喜饮酒。\n宦情随牒移，庸能累身口。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25607,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怀 其五","author":"韩淲","text":"潺潺涧声清，杳杳一径静。\n晴鸠唤雨鸠，屋角自相应。\n佳处无时无，领略在吾兴。\n万理钟自然，名物可争竞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25608,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怀 其六","author":"韩淲","text":"万言一杯水，驰辩漫摛藻。\n饰智以惊愚，去盗亦有道。\n吾衰梦周公，青春镜中老。\n富贵亲戚畏，位高金多好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25609,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"人生一世间，百年几晴阴。\n贵贱无定在，岁月徒自深。\n世路有夷险，宦业多升沉。\n未能率此性，于何不动心。\n在彼犹在己，视古犹视今。\n不须问行藏，且图豁胸襟。\n邻翁有酒不，对我成清斟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25610,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"小雨不肯晴，烟中犹霢霂。\n出门泥未乾，枯柳弄微绿。\n皇皇欲何之，君子贵谨独。\n屋上幸有山，屋边亦种木。\n西风绕东篱，秋来更多菊。\n采撷升中堂，悠然兴自足。\n断弦尚何问，鸾胶有谁续。\n居今实思古，孜孜慕前躅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25611,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"虚堂倚修竹，冷冷自苍翠。\n东轩亦不恶，小山发丛桂。\n残蝉犹啾啁，新雁已嘹唳。\n抚几怜岁华，何用苦文字。\n颜子曲肱眠，陶令日日醉。\n鄙哉乘时者，急急死名利。\n百年归山丘，等无身口累。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25612,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"我爱渊明诗，超出俗调度。\n执卷良自羞，在手不忍去。\n有时成诵之，行歌倚松树。\n好风从西来，潇然尚何虑。\n三叹或已暮，不知衣上露。\n俗物忽败人，苍茫认归路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25613,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其五","author":"韩淲","text":"秋月从天来，照人光清寒。\n起舞或四顾，夜色明飞栏。\n举杯与之笑，不知颓玉山。\n醉倒复自起，挥手扪天关。\n衡门终局促，空戴头上冠。\n焉得万里沙，校猎驰雕鞍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25614,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其六","author":"韩淲","text":"读书求甚解，汲汲何时已。\n纷然四海间，臭味少相似。\n人谁识致知，人谁务穷理。\n不专尚空言，但祇事苛礼。\n曾莫如老庄，犹解究生死。\n斯文今沦亡，吁嗟乎馀子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25615,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]